{"id":"12-816-19-25","zh":"人的集合是 mānussaka，或 mānussa。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-817-2-4","zh":"加 ṇa 之后——","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-817-5-20","zh":"依“jhalānamiyuvā sare vā”中的 vā 字，把 i 替换为 aya，得 dvaya、taya。","confidence":65}
{"id":"12-817-21-30","zh":"同样，依“gāmajanabandhusahāyādīhi tā”加 tā。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-817-31-34","zh":"gāmatā（村落的集合）、nāgaratā（市民的集合）。","confidence":70}
